\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces \textbf  {Table 6.} Bootstrap 95 \% confidence intervals (2,000 resamples) and Cohen's \emph  {d} for pooled Deletion AUC over the evaluated sample set. Because samples are nested within only three independently trained seeds, these intervals describe uncertainty over the sample pool and should not be interpreted as a substitute for a hierarchical or seed-level uncertainty estimate. $|d| > 1.1$ indicates a large effect}}{21}{table.caption.30}\protected@file@percent }
